{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仕", "id": "仕"}, {"form": "入", "id": "入"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "次", "id": "次"}, {"form": "禦", "id": "禦"}, {"form": "禮", "variants": [], "id": "禮"}, {"form": "繼", "id": "繼"}, {"form": "肉", "id": "肉"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "託", "id": "託"}, {"form": "誅", "id": "誅"}, {"form": "請", "id": "請"}, {"form": "諸侯", "id": "諸侯"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}, {"form": "際", "id": "際"}, {"form": "餽", "id": "餽"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.178532444324067, "source": "次", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.9065987288404251, "source": "次", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.2134515482804797, "source": "禦", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.178532444324067, "source": "禦", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 3.5648268054439574, "source": "禦", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 2.8716796248840124, "source": "禦", "target": "門"}, {"weight": 2.8716796248840124, "source": "禦", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.178532444324067, "source": "禦", "target": "諸侯"}, {"weight": 2.3608540011180215, "source": "餽", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.7190001149456267, "source": "餽", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 3.2771447329921766, "source": "餽", "target": "肉"}, {"weight": 1.655284300559519, "source": "見", "target": "仕"}, {"weight": 1.7730673362159026, "source": "見", "target": "諸侯"}, {"weight": 0.9080698987292979, "source": "見", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.